   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Adds 119 labels from two made-up labellers so you can see the measured scores before\nlabelling anything yourself. They are marked as sample everywhere and are not real judgments.",
