   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Six answers, keys 1 to 6. Five count\n(four kinds of related, or different\nthings). \u201cCannot tell\u201d leaves the pair\nout of the numbers. A note can travel\nwith the label, a skipped pair comes\nback last, the last label can be undone.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Six answers, keys 1 to 6. Five count\n(four kinds of related, or different\nthings). \u201cCannot tell\u201d leaves the pair\nout of the numbers. A note can travel\nwith the label, a skipped pair comes\nback last, the last label can be undone.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
