   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Alone means nothing similar was found, or a person took it out of its cluster.\nThose are the ones decided one at a time. A requirement in a cluster is decided\nwith its cluster.",
