   "text": "Every group gets a code and a reason. A\nheld group is still reviewed by people,\nfrom the mechanical results. The\nsample\u2019s AI answers that already exist\nare hidden for held groups; in the\npipeline the gate runs before the call,\nso no answer is ever made for them.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Every group gets a code and a reason. A\nheld group is still reviewed by people,\nfrom the mechanical results. The\nsample\u2019s AI answers that already exist\nare hidden for held groups; in the\npipeline the gate runs before the call,\nso no answer is ever made for them.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
