   "text": "A file that fails any of these is refused, the reason is shown, and the work in the browser is left\nas it was. Entries for things the project does not have, or in the wrong shape, are left out and\ncounted in the summary.",
   "fontSize": 10,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
